  "Description": "AH-6J/MH-6J v1.3 hard-landing headroom calibration. Keeps the v1.2 phase-derived rotor, smoothed ETL, soft/skid detail, and liftoff cues. During a firm touchdown, the body impact takes priority and ducks concurrent ground-bump, skid-detail, and settling events to avoid summed shaker demand.",
